llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,1154,2026-05-06 01:51:01.080,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,2,Remove the double-encoding at the caller (ts-gateway-service) by ensuring `accountId` is not pre-encoded before passing to the downstream endpoint.
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,1154,2026-05-06 01:51:01.080,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,3,"Alternatively, configure `StrictHttpFirewall` to allow `%25` by overriding `setAllowUrlEncodedPercent(true)` on the `DefaultHttpFirewall` bean in ts-contacts-service:"
