llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,1372,2026-05-06 02:30:57.941,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,0,ROOT CAUSE: `ts-admin-basic-info-service` fails at `AdminBasicInfoController.addTrain` because JSON deserialization of `TrainType.averageSpeed` field receives value `-9223372036854775808` (Long.MIN_VALUE) which exceeds `int` range (-2147483648 to 2147483647). This causes `HttpMessageNotReadableException`. The `ts-gateway-service` returns HTTP 400 as a direct consequence of propagating this malformed request.
