llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,2621,2026-05-06 05:56:41.972,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,0,"ROOT CAUSE: `ts-consign-service` JSON deserialization failure at `ConsignController.updateConsign`. The request body contains an array where a string value is expected for field `accountId` in `consign.entity.Consign`. The gateway service propagated the malformed PUT request, returning HTTP 400."
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,2621,2026-05-06 05:56:41.972,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,1,FIX:
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,2621,2026-05-06 05:56:41.972,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,2,"Fix the client sending the PUT request to provide a string value (not array) for `accountId` in the JSON payload, e.g., `""accountId"": ""123""` instead of `""accountId"": [""123""]`."
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,2621,2026-05-06 05:56:41.972,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,3,Add server-side validation in `ConsignController.updateConsign` to reject malformed input with a descriptive error message.
