llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,2641,2026-05-06 05:59:44.690,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,1,"`INSERT` into `ts.consign_record` table fails because `order_id` column value exceeds maximum length (likely VARCHAR limit). The error `Data truncation: Data too long for column 'order_id'` indicates the incoming order ID string is longer than the column definition (e.g., VARCHAR(255) vs actual value length)."
