llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,2647,2026-05-06 06:00:24.338,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,0,"ROOT CAUSE: `ts-consign-service` `ConsignController.updateConsign` fails with `HttpMessageNotReadableException` due to JSON deserialization error at `consign.entity.Consign[""to""]`. The `to` field expects a `String` but receives a JSON object (`START_OBJECT token`). This is the primary failure; the `ts-gateway-service` 400 is a downstream consequence."
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,2647,2026-05-06 06:00:24.338,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,1,"FIX: Update `consign.entity.Consign` class: change `to` field type from `String` to a proper object type (e.g., `ConsignInfo` or `Map<String, Object>`) that matches the JSON structure being sent in the PUT request body. Alternatively, modify the client sending the PUT request to serialize the `to` value as a simple string instead of an object."
