llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,2670,2026-05-06 06:03:52.937,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,0,ROOT CAUSE:
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,2670,2026-05-06 06:03:52.937,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,1,"ts-consign-service.ConsignController.updateConsign fails on JSON deserialization of field `weight` in `consign.entity.Consign`. The client sent the string `""infinity""` for a `double` field, which Jackson cannot parse. This causes HTTP 400 returned by ts-gateway-service."
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,2670,2026-05-06 06:03:52.937,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,2,FIX:
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,2670,2026-05-06 06:03:52.937,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,3,Validate request payload in API gateway or client to reject non-numeric weight values before reaching ts-consign-service.
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,2670,2026-05-06 06:03:52.937,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,4,"In ts-consign-service, add `@JsonDeserialize(using = DoubleDeserializer.class)` on the `weight` field or use custom deserializer to handle `""infinity""` as a special case (e.g., map to `Double.POSITIVE_INFINITY` or reject with clear error message)."
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,2670,2026-05-06 06:03:52.937,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,5,"Alternatively, change `weight` field type to `String` and parse in business logic."
