llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,2674,2026-05-06 06:04:04.855,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,0,**ROOT CAUSE:**
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,2674,2026-05-06 06:04:04.855,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,1,"`ts-consign-service.ConsignController.updateConsign` fails due to **Jackson deserialization error**: `consign.entity.Consign[""consignee""]` expects a `String` but receives a JSON object (`START_OBJECT token`). The PUT request body sent from `ts-gateway-service` contains a nested object for the `consignee` field instead of a plain string value."
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,2674,2026-05-06 06:04:04.855,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,2,**FIX:**
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,2674,2026-05-06 06:04:04.855,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,3,"In `ts-gateway-service`, ensure the `consignee` field in the PUT request body is sent as a **plain string** (e.g., `""consignee"": ""John Doe""`), not as a JSON object."
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,2674,2026-05-06 06:04:04.855,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,4,"If `consignee` must support complex structures (e.g., `{""name"": ""John"", ""phone"": ""123""}`), change the `Consign` entity field type in `ts-consign-service`"
