llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,2714,2026-05-06 06:10:22.146,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,0,"ROOT CAUSE: `ts-consign-service` `ConsignController.updateConsign` fails with `HttpMessageNotReadableException` due to JSON deserialization failure at `consign.entity.Consign[""within""]` field. The field expects `boolean` but receives string `""maybe""`, which is neither `""true""` nor `""false""`. This causes HTTP 400 in `ts-gateway-service`."
