llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,2719,2026-05-06 06:10:46.411,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,0,"ROOT CAUSE: ts-consign-service ConsignController.updateConsign failed due to JSON deserialization error. The request body contains a complex object for the ""from"" field of Consign entity, but the API expects a plain String. Jackson fails at line 1, column 84 when attempting to deserialize a START_OBJECT token into a String type."
