llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,2719,2026-05-06 06:10:46.411,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,2,"Update Consign entity's ""from"" field type from String to the appropriate object type that matches the incoming JSON structure."
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,2719,2026-05-06 06:10:46.411,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,3,"Alternatively, modify the request payload to send a plain String value (e.g., ""from"": ""value"") instead of a JSON object for the ""from"" field."
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,2719,2026-05-06 06:10:46.411,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,4,Verify the API contract between ts-gateway-service and ts-consign-service to ensure request body format matches the expected schema.
