llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,2869,2026-05-06 06:32:08.860,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,1,"FIX: Ensure the `targetDate` field in the PUT request body is a JSON string (e.g., `""2024-01-01""`), not a JSON object. Validate client payload format. If `targetDate` should be a complex type, update the `Consign` entity to accept an object or adjust the deserialization configuration."
