llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,5149,2026-05-06 10:41:47.321,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,3,"If the percent sign is intentional data, configure Spring Security's StrictHttpFirewall to allow percent signs by adding a custom FirewalledRequest or overriding `isAllowedHttpCharacter` in `DefaultHttpFirewall` to accept `%`."
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,5149,2026-05-06 10:41:47.321,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,4,"Alternatively, upgrade to Spring Security 5.4+ and set `StrictHttpFirewall.setAllowUrlEncodedPercent(true)`."
