llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,5453,2026-05-06 11:22:09.938,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,1,"FIX: Correct the JSON payload sent to `POST /api/v1/adminbasicservice/adminbasicinfo/trains` endpoint. Ensure `TrainType.name` field is a string value (e.g., `""name"": ""Express""`), not a JSON array (e.g., `""name"": [""Express""]`). Validate the request body in the calling service to match the expected schema."
