llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,5536,2026-05-06 11:29:58.210,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,3,Ensure the client sends a valid integer for `averageSpeed` in the JSON request body to the POST endpoint of `ts-admin-basic-info-service`.
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,5536,2026-05-06 11:29:58.210,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,4,"Add server-side input validation (e.g., `@Valid` with custom validator) to reject non-integer values before deserialization."
