llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6545,2026-05-06 14:06:17.625,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,0,"ROOT CAUSE: `ts-consign-service` GET `/api/v1/consignservice/consigns/order/{id}` failed with HTTP 403 due to `RequestRejectedException`. The URL contained `%25` (URL-encoded `%`), which was flagged as a malicious pattern by Spring Security's strict firewall. This is a single root cause; the second failed span in `ts-gateway-service` is a propagated failure from this rejection."
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6545,2026-05-06 14:06:17.625,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,1,"FIX: Either (1) add the endpoint path to the allowed URL patterns in Spring Security's `StrictHttpFirewall` configuration by overriding `StrictHttpFirewall.setAllowedUrlPatterns(Patterns)` to permit `%25` in URLs, or (2) replace `StrictHttpFirewall` with a custom firewall that allows `%25` for this specific endpoint. Ensure the client does not double-encode `%` in request parameters."
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6546,2026-05-06 14:06:39.743,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,0,PARAMETER_ERROR: YES
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6546,2026-05-06 14:06:39.743,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,1,PARAMETER: id
