llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6547,2026-05-06 14:06:40.830,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,0,"ROOT CAUSE: `ts-consign-service` GET /api/v1/consignservice/consigns/order/{id} failed with HTTP 403 due to `RequestRejectedException` — the URL contained `%25` (URL-encoded `%`), which was blocked by Spring Security's strict firewall as a potentially malicious character."
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6547,2026-05-06 14:06:40.830,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,1,FIX:
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6547,2026-05-06 14:06:40.830,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,2,"In `ts-consign-service`, configure `StrictHttpFirewall` to allow `%25` in URLs:"
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6547,2026-05-06 14:06:40.830,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,3,```java
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6547,2026-05-06 14:06:40.830,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,4,@Bean
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6547,2026-05-06 14:06:40.830,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,5,public HttpFirewall allowUrlEncodedPercent() {
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6547,2026-05-06 14:06:40.830,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,6,StrictHttpFirewall firewall = new StrictHttpFirewall();
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6547,2026-05-06 14:06:40.830,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,7,firewall.setAllowUrlEncodedPercent(true);
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6547,2026-05-06 14:06:40.830,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,8,return firewall;
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6547,2026-05-06 14:06:40.830,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,9,}
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6547,2026-05-06 14:06:40.830,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,10,```
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6547,2026-05-06 14:06:40.830,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,11,"Alternatively, if the `%25` is unintentional, fix the upstream caller (`ts-gateway-service`) to not double-encode the `%` character in the `{id}` path parameter before"
