llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6549,2026-05-06 14:07:13.641,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,0,"**ROOT CAUSE:** `ts-consign-service` → `ConsignController.findByOrderId` receives invalid UUID string ""12345"" from upstream request. `java.util.UUID.fromString()` throws `IllegalArgumentException` because ""12345"" does not conform to UUID format (expected 36-char hex with hyphens)."
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6549,2026-05-06 14:07:13.641,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,1,**FIX:** Validate UUID format at `ts-gateway-service` before forwarding to `ts-consign-service`. Either:
