llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6551,2026-05-06 14:07:54.801,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,1,FIX:
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6551,2026-05-06 14:07:54.801,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,2,Remove or decode double-encoding at source before URL construction.
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6551,2026-05-06 14:07:54.801,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,3,Configure StrictHttpFirewall to allow `%25` by adding `allowedHttpMethods` or `allowUrlEncodedPercent` in security configuration.
