llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6581,2026-05-06 14:15:25.851,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,0,"ROOT CAUSE: ts-consign-service GET /api/v1/consignservice/consigns/order/{id} failed with HTTP 403 due to RequestRejectedException. The URL contained ""%25"" (URL-encoded '%' character), which was rejected by Spring Security's HTTP firewall as a potentially malicious string."
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6581,2026-05-06 14:15:25.851,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,1,FIX:
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6581,2026-05-06 14:15:25.851,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,2,"In ts-consign-service, configure Spring Security's StrictHttpFirewall to allow encoded percent signs by adding: `StrictHttpFirewall firewall = new StrictHttpFirewall(); firewall.setAllowUrlEncodedPercent(true);`"
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6581,2026-05-06 14:15:25.851,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,3,"Alternatively, if the ""%25"" is unintentional, fix the caller (ts-gateway-service) to not double-encode URL parameters. Ensure the gateway forwards the original {id} value without additional URL encoding."
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6582,2026-05-06 14:15:37.891,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,0,PARAMETER_ERROR: YES
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6582,2026-05-06 14:15:37.891,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,1,PARAMETER: id
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6582,2026-05-06 14:15:37.891,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,2,ERROR_TYPE: FORMAT_ERROR
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6583,2026-05-06 14:15:39.056,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,0,"ROOT CAUSE: ts-consign-service GET /api/v1/consignservice/consigns/order/{id} failed with HTTP 403 due to RequestRejectedException from Spring Security firewall. The URL contained ""%25"" (URL-encoded percent sign) which was flagged as a potentially malicious pattern by the default StrictHttpFirewall configuration."
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6583,2026-05-06 14:15:39.056,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,1,FIX: Configure Spring Security's StrictHttpFirewall in ts-consign-service to allow percent-encoded characters by either:
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6583,2026-05-06 14:15:39.056,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,2,"Adding `http.firewall(new DefaultHttpFirewall())` to the security configuration, or"
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6583,2026-05-06 14:15:39.056,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,3,Customizing StrictHttpFirewall with `setAllowUrlEncodedPercent(true)`
