llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6623,2026-05-06 14:21:58.962,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,0,"ROOT CAUSE: Root cause #1 in ts-consign-service at ConsignController.updateConsign. The PUT request body sends a JSON array for the ""accountId"" field, but the Consign entity expects a String. Jackson fails deserialization at line 1, column 14. This causes HTTP 400 in ts-gateway-service (root cause #2) as the gateway passes the malformed request upstream."
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6623,2026-05-06 14:21:58.962,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,1,"FIX: In the client sending the PUT request to /api/v1/consignservice/consigns, change the ""accountId"" value from an array (e.g., [""value""]) to a plain string (e.g., ""value""). Verify the request payload matches the Consign entity schema: ""accountId"" must be a JSON string, not an array."
