llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6681,2026-05-06 14:29:05.145,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,0,**ROOT CAUSE:**
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6681,2026-05-06 14:29:05.145,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,1,`ts-consign-service` fails on `ConsignController.updateConsign` due to JSON deserialization mismatch. The field `consignee` is expected as a `String` but receives a JSON object (`START_OBJECT token`). This causes `HttpMessageNotReadableException`. The gateway (`ts-gateway-service`) propagates a 400 error because the upstream service cannot parse the request body.
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6681,2026-05-06 14:29:05.145,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,2,**FIX:**
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6681,2026-05-06 14:29:05.145,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,3,"Correct the JSON payload sent to `PUT /api/v1/consignservice/consigns` so that the `consignee` field is a plain string (e.g., `""John Doe""`), not an object. Alternatively, update the `Consign` entity’s `consignee` field type to match the expected structure (e.g., a nested object/class) and adjust deserialization accordingly. Validate the request schema before sending."
