llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6721,2026-05-06 14:34:19.704,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,0,"ROOT CAUSE: `ts-consign-service` `ConsignController.updateConsign` fails because JSON field `""within""` receives string `""maybe""` but entity `Consign.within` is declared as `boolean`. Jackson deserialization rejects non-boolean string. `ts-gateway-service` returns HTTP 400 due to propagation of this deserialization error."
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6721,2026-05-06 14:34:19.704,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,1,"FIX: Change `Consign.within` field type from `boolean` to `String` in `consign.entity.Consign` class. Update all validation and business logic in `ts-consign-service` to handle `""maybe""`, `""true""`, `""false""` string values. Alternatively, correct upstream client to send only `true` or `false` for `""within""` field."
