llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6776,2026-05-06 14:40:58.349,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,0,"ROOT CAUSE: `ts-consign-service` operation `ConsignController.updateConsign` fails due to deserialization error. The JSON body for the PUT request contains an object value for the `orderId` field instead of a plain string. Specifically, at line 1, column 124, the parser encounters a START_OBJECT token where a String is expected for `consign.entity.Consign[""orderId""]`. This causes `HttpMessageNotReadableException`, leading to HTTP 400 from `ts-gateway-service`."
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6776,2026-05-06 14:40:58.349,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,1,"FIX: Correct the JSON payload sent to the `PUT` endpoint of `ts-consign-service`. Ensure the `orderId` field is a JSON string (e.g., `""orderId"": ""some-string-value""`), not a JSON object (e.g., `""orderId"": { ... }`). Validate the request body structure in the calling service (likely the client or upstream service triggering this PUT)"
