llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6928,2026-05-06 15:00:22.942,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,0,ROOT CAUSE: ts-consign-service.ConsignController.updateConsign receives HTTP PUT request with JSON payload where field `phone` is sent as an array (START_ARRAY token) instead of a string. Jackson deserialization fails because `Consign.phone` is typed `String` but receives `[...]`. This causes HTTP 400 in ts-gateway-service proxy.
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6928,2026-05-06 15:00:22.942,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,1,FIX:
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6928,2026-05-06 15:00:22.942,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,2,In ts-consign-service: Change `Consign.phone` field type to `List<String>` or create a custom deserializer to handle array input.
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6928,2026-05-06 15:00:22.942,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,3,"In calling client: Ensure `phone` field is sent as a JSON string (e.g., `""phone"": ""1234567890""`), not an array (e.g., `""phone"": [""1234567890""]`)."
