llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6970,2026-05-06 15:05:18.962,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,0,ROOT CAUSE:
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6970,2026-05-06 15:05:18.962,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,1,"`ts-consign-service` `ConsignController.updateConsign` fails because HTTP request body sends `accountId` as a JSON object (`START_OBJECT token`) instead of a plain string. Jackson deserialization expects `String` type for `Consign.accountId` field, causing `HttpMessageNotReadableException`. Downstream `ts-gateway-service` returns HTTP 400 due to this malformed request."
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6970,2026-05-06 15:05:18.962,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,2,FIX:
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6970,2026-05-06 15:05:18.962,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,3,"Ensure client sending PUT request to `ConsignController.updateConsign` provides `accountId` as a JSON string (e.g., `""accountId"": ""value""`), not an object (e.g., `""accountId"": {}` or `""accountId"": {""nested"": ""data""}`). Validate request payload structure against `Consign` entity schema."
