llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6975,2026-05-06 15:05:37.377,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,0,ROOT CAUSE: `ts-consign-service` fails at `ConsignController.updateConsign` due to JSON deserialization error: field `to` in `consign.entity.Consign` expects a `String` but receives a JSON array (START_ARRAY token). This causes HTTP 400 propagated to `ts-gateway-service`.
