llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6990,2026-05-06 15:07:43.221,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,0,"ROOT CAUSE: `ts-consign-service` fails on `ConsignController.updateConsign` due to JSON deserialization error. The `Consign` entity's `id` field (type `String`) receives a JSON array token (`[` ) instead of a string value at column 112 of the request body. This causes `HttpMessageNotReadableException`, returning HTTP 0 (no response sent). The `ts-gateway-service` propagates this as HTTP 400."
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,6990,2026-05-06 15:07:43.221,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,1,"FIX: In the client sending the PUT request to `ts-consign-service`, ensure the `id` field in the JSON body is a string (e.g., `""id"": ""value""`), not an array (e.g., `""id"": [""value""]`). Validate request payload schema against `consign.entity.Consign` definition. If the client is another service, correct its serialization logic. If the gateway, inspect its request transformation"
