llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,7023,2026-05-06 15:11:30.976,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,1,"FIX: Change the client sending the PUT request to `ts-consign-service` to serialize the `""within""` field as lowercase `true` or `false`. Alternatively, add `@JsonFormat(shape = JsonFormat.Shape.STRING)` or a custom deserializer to the `within` field in `consign.entity.Consign` to accept `""TRUE""`, `""True""`, etc."
