llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,7058,2026-05-06 15:16:09.724,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,0,"ROOT CAUSE: `ts-consign-service` fails on `ConsignController.updateConsign` due to JSON deserialization error at `Consign[""targetDate""]`. The `targetDate` field expects a `java.lang.String` but receives a JSON array (START_ARRAY token). This occurs because `ts-gateway-service` sends a PUT request with malformed JSON payload where `targetDate` is formatted as an array instead of a string."
llm-communication-20260505-225616.log,7058,2026-05-06 15:16:09.724,deepseek-chat,other,,,,,,,,,,,,1,"FIX: Correct the JSON payload sent by the PUT request to `ts-consign-service` so that `targetDate` is a string value (e.g., `""2025-01-01""`) rather than an array. Alternatively, update the `Consign` entity's `targetDate` field type to accept arrays if that is the intended data format. Validate and sanitize input at `ts-gateway-service` before forwarding to `ts-consign-service`."
